    993  1b18							; MONO legato on voice t0 (channel t1): from vOut to mtTarget without a new
    994  1b18							; attack. Game Boy: the new note-on first, then the old note-off (with CC 68
    995  1b18							; on it changes pitch, gliding if the sound glides). MidiNES: off, then on,
    996  1b18							; and the CC7 envelope carries on where it was.
