    352  308a							; ------------------------------------------------------------ SysEx: a patch from Chip Lab (v0.20)
    353  308a							; F0 7D 46 43 01 PATCH_SIZE, then the patch (PATCH_SIZE bytes, the live patch's layout:
    354  308a							; tools/gen_patches.py) as two 4-bit halves each, high first, then F7. It
    355  308a							; arrives in sxBuf; only a complete one goes into the live patch, which then
    356  308a							; sounds at once (like choosing a sound). Anything else is ignored.
    357  308a		       00 05	   SX_HEAD    equ	5
    358  308a		       00 ab	   SX_LEN     equ	SX_HEAD + PATCH_SIZE * 2
    359  308a
    360  308a							; A status byte in A (F0-F7); keeps A
    361  308a				   SysexStatus
    362  308a					      subroutine
